    <string name="ui_confidence_is_a_sample_size_heuristic_not_statistical_certai" formatted="false">Confidence is a sample-size heuristic, not statistical certainty: under 5 insufficient, 5–14 low, 15–29 medium, 30+ high. Comparisons use the smaller of the two sample groups. Mood values are saved with each entry, so later customization does not rewrite history.</string>
