    <string name="ui_statistics_methodology" formatted="false">Statistics methodology</string>
    <string name="ui_entries_retain_their_mood_score_when_you_customize_moods_tre" formatted="false">Entries retain their mood score when you customize moods. Trends average each local day\'s entries. Activity frequency counts entries; recorded-day frequency is separate. Same-entry association compares mean mood with and without the activity. Next-day analysis compares next-day daily averages after recorded source days with and without the activity. Each date counts once. Missing following days are omitted; both dates must lie in the chosen range. These are observational associations, not causal effects. Sample confidence is a heuristic based on the smaller comparison group, not a formal confidence interval.</string>
    <string name="ui_dates_and_privacy" formatted="false">Dates and privacy</string>
    <string name="ui_entry_timestamps_are_absolute_instants_shown_in_the_current_" formatted="false">Entry timestamps are absolute instants shown in the current device timezone. Travel or timezone changes can move an entry into another local date. Day-based goals and important dates retain their calendar dates. Linked completions are recalculated. Backups are versioned ZIP archives, not encrypted. PINs and account credentials are excluded. App lock supplements Android device security.</string>
